<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Set Password Email</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background: #f3f4f6;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      color: #1f2937;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 550px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background: #fff;
      padding: 40px 30px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6, #6366f1);
      padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    h2 {
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: 22px;
      color: #111827;
    }
    p {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #4b5563;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 15px 0 25px;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 28px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6, #6366f1);
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: 15px;
      transition: 0.3s ease-in-out;
    }
    .button:hover {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #4f46e5);
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #6b7280;
      border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      padding-top: 20px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">🔐 Secure Access</div>
    <h2>Set Your Password</h2>
    <p>You're almost there! Click the button below to set a new password and activate your account securely.</p>
<a href="http://localhost:5173/set-password?token=<%= token %>" 
   class="button" 
   style="color: #ffffff !important; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; 
          padding: 12px 28px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6, #6366f1); 
          border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15px;">
  Set Password
</a>
    <div class="footer">
      If you didn’t request this, you can safely ignore this email.<br />
      © 2025 Article Post. All rights reserved.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
